  "provenance_basis": "Every runtime SFX in this game is rendered locally by the python_sound_assets generators. Each artifact below records the generator package, its cue, the exact seed, the render options, and the SHA-256 of the shipped file; renders are reproducible from those values.",
  "provider": "local procedural generators (python_sound_assets)",
  "replaces": {
    "previous_model": "eleven_text_to_sound_v2",
    "previous_provider": "ElevenLabs",
    "reason": "The ElevenLabs bank was licence-restricted: its use depended on an active paid subscription and remained subject to the ElevenLabs sound-effects terms, which constrained redistribution. All 23 runtime WAVs were replaced with the locally generated CC0-derived bank described here. No asset in this game originates from ElevenLabs any more, so that provider's prompt and attestation records have been removed rather than left as a stale claim."
  },
